{"title":"2005 Cyprus Seniors TST/Day 1/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Cyprus_Seniors_TST/Day_1/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the area of the region bounded between the points (x,y) of the plane that satisfy the relation:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/1/591a3a9b2c622eca2b40124291b09825c100bc00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9x^3+9x^2y-45x^2=4y^3+4xy^2-20y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"309\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Cyprus_Seniors_TST/Day_1/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<hr />\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Cyprus_Seniors_TST/Day_1/Problem_2\" title=\"2005 Cyprus Seniors TST/Day 1/Problem 2\">Next Problem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Cyprus_Seniors_TST/Day_1\" title=\"2005 Cyprus Seniors TST/Day 1\">Back to Exam</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Cyprus_Seniors_TST/Day_1/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Seniors_Team_Selection_Tests\" title=\"Cyprus Seniors Team Selection Tests\">Cyprus Seniors Team Selection Tests</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?tit